# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use gates and readout instructions on IBM QPUs that are calibrated differently from the default set, such as slow gates and shorter measurements"
msgstr "Gunakan gate dan arahan bacaan pada QPU IBM yang ditentukur secara berbeza daripada set lalai, seperti gate perlahan dan pengukuran yang lebih singkat"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specially calibrated instructions"
msgstr "Arahan yang ditentukur khas"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specially calibrated instructions {#specially-calibrated-instructions}"
msgstr "Arahan yang ditentukur khas {#specially-calibrated-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, the quantum gates and readout operations on IBM&reg; quantum computers are calibrated for optimal performance across general use cases. Some workloads, however, benefit from instructions whose parameters are tuned differently. For example, [`MidCircuitMeasure`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) (`measure_2`) is a readout operation tailored for measurements in the middle of a circuit, and slower `cz` gates can improve the results of some error mitigation workflows.\n"
msgstr "Secara lalai, gate kuantum dan operasi bacaan pada komputer kuantum IBM&reg; ditentukur untuk prestasi optimum merentasi kes penggunaan umum. Namun, sesetengah beban kerja mendapat manfaat daripada arahan yang parameternya ditala secara berbeza. Contohnya, [`MidCircuitMeasure`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) (`measure_2`) ialah operasi bacaan yang dirancang untuk pengukuran di pertengahan litar, dan gate `cz` yang lebih perlahan boleh memperbaik hasil sesetengah aliran kerja mitigasi ralat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specially calibrated instructions come in two forms, and you access them differently:\n"
msgstr "Arahan yang ditentukur khas terdapat dalam dua bentuk, dan anda mengaksesnya dengan cara yang berbeza:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[**Instructions with different signatures**](#different) are calibrated alongside the standard instructions in the default calibration, so you add them to your circuits like any other instruction. They are usually identified by a suffix, such as `measure_2`.\n"
msgstr "[**Arahan dengan tandatangan berbeza**](#different) ditentukur bersama arahan standard dalam penentukuran lalai, jadi anda menambahkannya pada litar anda seperti arahan lain. Arahan ini biasanya dikenal pasti melalui akhiran, seperti `measure_2`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[**Alternative calibrations**](#alternative-calibrations) replace parts of the default calibration with differently tuned parameters. You select one by passing a `calibration_id` when you retrieve the backend.\n"
msgstr "[**Penentukuran alternatif**](#alternative-calibrations) menggantikan sebahagian daripada penentukuran lalai dengan parameter yang ditala secara berbeza. Anda memilih satu dengan menghantar `calibration_id` apabila anda mendapatkan backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To learn how IBM quantum computers are calibrated, see [Monitor, calibrate, and benchmark](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengetahui cara komputer kuantum IBM ditentukur, lihat [Pantau, tentukur dan tanda aras](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"different\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instructions with different signatures {#instructions-with-different-signatures}"
msgstr "Arahan dengan tandatangan berbeza {#instructions-with-different-signatures}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These instructions are calibrated with the standard instruction set, so you don't need to do anything special to retrieve a backend that supports them. To use one, add the corresponding `qiskit-ibm-runtime` instruction to your circuit.\n"
msgstr "Arahan ini ditentukur bersama set arahan standard, jadi anda tidak perlu melakukan apa-apa yang khas untuk mendapatkan backend yang menyokongnya. Untuk menggunakannya, tambahkan arahan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` yang sepadan pada litar anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Instruction | Description | Typical use case | Use in Qiskit | Processor family |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `measure_2` | Shorter measurement pulse | [Mid-circuit measurements](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) | [`MidCircuitMeasure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-measure) (v0.43.0 or later) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `reset_2` | Shorter conditional reset pulse that uses `measure_2` | Mid-circuit qubit reset | [`MidCircuitReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-reset) (v0.49.0 or later) | Heron |\n"
"| `measure_reset` | Measurement like `measure` that also resets the qubit* | Measure and reset a qubit | [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) (v0.50.0 or later) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `measure_reset_2` | Shorter measurement like `measure_2` that also resets the qubit* | Measure and reset a qubit mid-circuit | Initialize [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) with `name=\"measure_reset_2\"` (v0.50.0 or later) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `xslow` | Bit-flip (X) gate with an extended duration | [Postselection](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) and error mitigation. It is the default value of the `x_pulse_type` option in [postselection passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-mitigation/postselection-passes) | All |\n"
". | [`XSlowGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-x-slow-gate#xslowgate) (v0.50.0 or later) | All |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Arahan | Penerangan | Kes penggunaan tipikal | Penggunaan dalam Qiskit | Keluarga pemproses |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `measure_2` | Denyutan pengukuran yang lebih singkat | [Pengukuran pertengahan litar](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) | [`MidCircuitMeasure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-measure) (v0.43.0 atau lebih baharu) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `reset_2` | Denyutan set semula bersyarat yang lebih singkat yang menggunakan `measure_2` | Set semula qubit pertengahan litar | [`MidCircuitReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-reset) (v0.49.0 atau lebih baharu) | Heron |\n"
"| `measure_reset` | Pengukuran seperti `measure` yang turut menetapkan semula qubit* | Ukur dan tetapkan semula qubit | [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) (v0.50.0 atau lebih baharu) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `measure_reset_2` | Pengukuran yang lebih singkat seperti `measure_2` yang turut menetapkan semula qubit* | Ukur dan tetapkan semula qubit di pertengahan litar | Mulakan [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) dengan `name=\"measure_reset_2\"` (v0.50.0 atau lebih baharu) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `xslow` | Gate balik-bit (X) dengan tempoh dilanjutkan | [Pasca-pemilihan](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) dan mitigasi ralat. Ia ialah nilai lalai pilihan `x_pulse_type` dalam [laluan pasca-pemilihan](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-mitigation/postselection-passes) | Semua |\n"
". | [`XSlowGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-x-slow-gate#xslowgate) (v0.50.0 atau lebih baharu) | Semua |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\* On Heron processors, the reset is conditional on the measurement result. On Nighthawk r2 processors, the reset is unconditional.\n"
msgstr "\\* Pada pemproses Heron, set semula bergantung pada keputusan pengukuran. Pada pemproses Nighthawk r2, set semula adalah tanpa syarat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because these instructions are not supported on every backend, check the backend's supported instructions before you use them:\n"
msgstr "Oleh sebab arahan ini tidak disokong pada setiap backend, semak arahan yang disokong oleh backend sebelum anda menggunakannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To find all backends that support an instruction, use:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mencari semua backend yang menyokong sesuatu arahan, gunakan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `instruction_signatures` to see the signatures of these specially calibrated instructions:\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `instruction_signatures` untuk melihat tandatangan arahan yang ditentukur khas ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternative calibrations {#alternative-calibrations}"
msgstr "Penentukuran alternatif {#alternative-calibrations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternative calibrations replace parts of the default calibration with differently tuned parameters. Each alternative calibration has a calibration ID, and its availability depends on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Penentukuran alternatif menggantikan sebahagian daripada penentukuran lalai dengan parameter yang ditala secara berbeza. Setiap penentukuran alternatif mempunyai ID penentukuran, dan ketersediaannya bergantung pada QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use an alternative calibration, pass its `calibration_id` when you retrieve the backend. The backend's target, and therefore the transpiler, uses the instruction properties from that calibration, and primitive jobs that you run on the backend execute with it.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan penentukuran alternatif, hantar `calibration_id`nya apabila anda mendapatkan backend. Sasaran backend, dan oleh itu Transpiler, menggunakan sifat arahan daripada penentukuran tersebut, dan tugas primitif yang anda jalankan pada backend dilaksanakan dengannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Alternative calibrations are not available on all QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Penentukuran alternatif tidak tersedia pada semua QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Slow gate calibrations {#slow-gate-calibrations}"
msgstr "Penentukuran gate perlahan {#slow-gate-calibrations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Slow gate calibrations tune the `cz` gate to be slower than in the default calibration. Slower `cz` gates might improve performance for large-scale observable estimation workflows with error mitigation, but they also increase the total duration of your circuit, which causes some additional decoherence.\n"
msgstr "Penentukuran gate perlahan menala gate `cz` supaya lebih perlahan daripada penentukuran lalai. Gate `cz` yang lebih perlahan mungkin meningkatkan prestasi bagi aliran kerja anggaran observable berskala besar dengan mitigasi ralat, tetapi ia juga menambah jumlah tempoh litar anda, yang menyebabkan sedikit dekoheren tambahan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Heron processors, slow gate calibrations are also available with two modes of two-level system (TLS) bias control:\n"
msgstr "Pada pemproses Heron, penentukuran gate perlahan turut tersedia dengan dua mod kawalan pincang sistem dua tahap (TLS):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**DC TLS bias** is optimized for the best instantaneous performance. The default calibration uses DC TLS bias.\n"
msgstr "**Pincang TLS DC** dioptimumkan untuk prestasi seketika yang terbaik. Penentukuran lalai menggunakan pincang TLS DC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**AC TLS bias** modulates the TLS bias to stabilize device errors over time, which keeps the device's noise model stable during lengthy workflows. See \"Noise stabilization\" in [Observable Estimation in the Absence of Classical Verification](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.25998#page=52) for details.\n"
msgstr "**Pincang TLS AC** memodulasi pincang TLS untuk menstabilkan ralat peranti dari semasa ke semasa, yang memastikan model hingar peranti stabil sepanjang aliran kerja yang panjang. Lihat \"Noise stabilization\" dalam [Observable Estimation in the Absence of Classical Verification](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.25998#page=52) untuk butiran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nighthawk processors do not use TLS bias, so they have a single slow gate calibration.\n"
msgstr "Pemproses Nighthawk tidak menggunakan pincang TLS, jadi ia mempunyai satu penentukuran gate perlahan sahaja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Calibration ID | Processor family | TLS bias | Recommended for |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| None (default calibration) | All | DC (Heron) | General use. Especially recommended for workloads whose bitstrings can be classically distilled, such as peaked circuits and [SQD or SKQD](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/sqd-skqd) workflows, and for workloads with [error detection](/tutorials/spacetime-codes). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_dc` | Heron | DC | Large-scale observable estimation workflows, especially those that use heuristic error mitigation such as zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_ac` | Heron | AC | Workflows that require stable error rates over long sessions. Strongly recommended for workflows that involve noise learning, such as probabilistic error amplification (PEA) and probabilistic error cancellation (PEC). |\n"
"| `slow_gates` | Nighthawk | Not applicable | Observable estimation workflows that use error mitigation, such as ZNE, PEA, and PEC. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ID penentukuran | Keluarga pemproses | Pincang TLS | Disyorkan untuk |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Tiada (penentukuran lalai) | Semua | DC (Heron) | Kegunaan am. Amat disyorkan untuk beban kerja yang rentetan bitnya boleh disuling secara klasik, seperti litar berpuncak dan aliran kerja [SQD atau SKQD](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/sqd-skqd), dan untuk beban kerja dengan [pengesanan ralat](/tutorials/spacetime-codes). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_dc` | Heron | DC | Aliran kerja anggaran observable berskala besar, terutamanya yang menggunakan mitigasi ralat heuristik seperti ekstrapolasi hingar sifar (ZNE). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_ac` | Heron | AC | Aliran kerja yang memerlukan kadar ralat stabil sepanjang sesi yang panjang. Amat disyorkan untuk aliran kerja yang melibatkan pembelajaran hingar, seperti penguatan ralat kebarangkalian (PEA) dan pembatalan ralat kebarangkalian (PEC). |\n"
"| `slow_gates` | Nighthawk | Tidak berkenaan | Aliran kerja anggaran observable yang menggunakan mitigasi ralat, seperti ZNE, PEA dan PEC. |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example:\n"
msgstr "Contohnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"When you use `slow_gates_ac`, submit all jobs in the workflow to a single [session](/guides/run-jobs-session) so that they run while the device's noise remains stable.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Apabila anda menggunakan `slow_gates_ac`, hantar semua tugas dalam aliran kerja ke satu [Session](/guides/run-jobs-session) supaya ia berjalan semasa hingar peranti kekal stabil.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check gate durations {#check-gate-durations}"
msgstr "Semak tempoh gate {#check-gate-durations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because slow gate calibrations increase `cz` gate durations, compare the durations against the default calibration to understand the effect on your circuit. Use the backend's target to find the duration, in seconds, of the `cz` gate on a specific pair of qubits:\n"
msgstr "Oleh sebab penentukuran gate perlahan menambah tempoh gate `cz`, bandingkan tempoh tersebut dengan penentukuran lalai untuk memahami kesannya pada litar anda. Gunakan sasaran backend untuk mencari tempoh, dalam saat, gate `cz` pada sepasang qubit tertentu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the target reflects the selected calibration, transpile your circuits against the backend that uses the same `calibration_id` you plan to run on.\n"
msgstr "Oleh sebab sasaran mencerminkan penentukuran yang dipilih, transpil litar anda terhadap backend yang menggunakan `calibration_id` yang sama dengan yang anda rancang untuk dijalankan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn how to [execute dynamic circuits](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits) with mid-circuit measurements.\n"
"- Use [postselection](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) to filter out results affected by correlated noise.\n"
"- Read about how IBM quantum computers are [monitored, calibrated, and benchmarked](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Ketahui cara [melaksanakan litar dinamik](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits) dengan pengukuran pertengahan litar.\n"
"- Gunakan [pasca-pemilihan](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) untuk menapis keputusan yang terjejas oleh hingar berkorelasi.\n"
"- Baca tentang cara komputer kuantum IBM [dipantau, ditentukur dan ditanda aras](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
